WEBVTT

00:00:00.210 --> 00:00:03.209
Welcome to Petorose Alcones Private Limited.

00:00:03.209 --> 00:00:07.209
I am Rose, an AI avatar and delighted to have you here.

00:00:07.209 --> 00:00:14.210
I am here to help you navigate and explore the captivating world of specialty aroma chemicals.

00:00:14.210 --> 00:00:18.210
Whether you're a seasoned perfumer or an expert flavourist,

00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:22.210
or simply intrigued by the ingredients that shape our senses,

00:00:22.210 --> 00:00:25.210
we're thrilled by your presence.

00:00:25.210 --> 00:00:29.210
As a part of the renowned Banwari Group that has pioneered the mint industry,

00:00:29.210 --> 00:00:31.210
headquartered in New Delhi, India,

00:00:31.210 --> 00:00:36.210
Petorose Alcones is built on the same principles and work ethics.

00:00:36.210 --> 00:00:40.210
Our ethos and value lies in innovating aromas.

00:00:40.210 --> 00:00:45.210
Our state-of-the-art manufacturing facility in Rajasthan ensures a seamless supply chain.

00:00:45.210 --> 00:00:50.210
We pride ourselves on delivering consistent quality and exceptional customer service,

00:00:50.210 --> 00:00:54.210
rigorously testing every product before it reaches you.

00:00:54.210 --> 00:00:58.210
Let me highlight three of our key offerings.

00:00:59.210 --> 00:01:04.209
First we have Chavibetol, a key component of betel leaf oil, with a spicy note.

00:01:04.209 --> 00:01:09.209
It can be a crucial ingredient for Betel fragrances and flavours.

00:01:09.209 --> 00:01:14.209
Next, Ethyl Isocaproate, a not-too-strong balanced fruity aroma.

00:01:14.209 --> 00:01:17.209
It is a volatile ester.

00:01:17.209 --> 00:01:23.209
And Para Propyl Phenol, a medicinal phenolic odour profile that is leathery, smoky,

00:01:23.209 --> 00:01:26.209
perfect for oud fragrances.

00:01:26.209 --> 00:01:31.209
These, along with our entire range of products, are proudly made in India.

00:01:31.209 --> 00:01:36.209
Now you may explore our website and discover more about our products.

00:01:36.209 --> 00:01:41.209
We are active communicators and would promptly respond to your email as well.

00:01:41.209 --> 00:01:44.209
We would also appreciate your connection on LinkedIn.

00:01:44.209 --> 00:01:50.209
You can directly download our brochure by scanning the QR code or request it on your WhatsApp.

00:01:50.209 --> 00:01:55.209
Today we are at the FAFAI International Convention and Expo 2025 Delhi.

00:01:55.209 --> 00:01:59.209
We're eager to connect with you and more than happy to send samples.

00:01:59.209 --> 00:02:03.209
It is our deepest desire that we contribute to your finest creations.

00:02:03.209 --> 00:02:05.209
This is Rose, signing off.

00:02:05.209 --> 00:02:07.209
Have a fragrant time.

